{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d850de9c-215e-813a-a340-d0dbc0494ae7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T12:40:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good afternoon. Jorge Rocha here. I'm on speakerphone, I've got my hands full, so tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Mr. Rocha. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I manage a property over on Spring Street, number 133, Fifth Ward. I'm looking into a mobile vendor license for this summer. Food cart, basically. Who handles that, you folks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do take those applications here in the clerk's office. Is this a cart that would sit in one spot or move around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moves around. Maybe a couple of regular stops, but it's on wheels. Not a truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally you'd fill out an application, and depending on what you're selling there can be a health department piece and an insurance requirement. I can have the application ready for you, or I can email the forms."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paper's fine. I'll come by. When does the season application open? I'd like to get ahead of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually it starts to pick up in the spring, but you can submit early. Nothing wrong with getting your paperwork in before the rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, a separate question. The cart operator has a dog that rides along, a service-type thing, more of a mascot honestly. Does the city take a copy of the rabies certificate, or do you need the original?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a dog license a copy of the rabies certificate is generally accepted, as long as it's legible and shows the vet's information and the dates. If it's a license for the dog, that is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the dog license. Copy is fine, then. Good. Does it have to be a color copy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black and white is okay as long as you can read everything. A phone photo printed out works too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That saves me a trip to the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else on the vendor side? Do you know what hours and locations you're thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Waterfront-ish, mostly, and lunch hours. I'll sort the exact spots after I see the application. If there's a map of restricted areas, I'd take that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check what we have. [pause] I don't have a printed map at the counter, but the application packet should list the areas where vending isn't allowed. If you have questions after you read it, ask me or I'll pass you to someone who knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And one more thing, unrelated. I've got a framed photo waiting for pickup at your office. Dropped it off a while back for the historic display, I think. Is it still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A framed photo. Do you remember who you gave it to, or about when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before the holidays. Black and white, wood frame, about so big, eleven by fourteen. Navy ship in it. My name's on a sticker on the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hold on a second and let me look in the back. [pause] Rocha, yes. I see an envelope with a note on it and a frame beside it. That's yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I can pick it up along with the application. Are you open through the afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're here until the end of the regular day today. Bring an ID if you have one, just so we can match the name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll be there within the hour, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Do you want me to put the vendor application with the photo so it's all together?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, do that. Can you note the callback number in case something comes up? It's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0154. Under Rocha."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, Rosa. See you shortly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Rocha. Drive safe."
    }
  ],
